# Ephemeral ingest lock (transaction.py, D21). Never committed; recreated per ingest.
.llmwiki.lock
# Ephemeral ingest transaction sidecar (ingest_driver.py, plan R-a). On-disk
# transaction state between begin and finish/abort; deleted on every terminal
# path, never committed.
.llmwiki.txn
# Ephemeral write-ahead undo journal dir (transaction.py). Pre-image backups +
# per-process journal segments; discarded on commit/rollback, never committed.
.llmwiki.txn.d/
# Optional qmd full-text search index (read/qmd_search.py). Project-local index +
# vectors (can be GBs); rebuilt from wiki/ on demand — never commit it.
.qmd/
